"scene_summary": "A narrow coastal asphalt road curls behind a sheer orange sandstone cliff, above steep scrub-covered rock slopes and a blue-grey sea.",
"environment_description": "This Cape Peninsula-style coastline has late-summer olive-green coastal scrub, sparse straw-coloured grasses and extensive exposed bedrock. A towering, horizontally layered orange sandstone road cutting fills the left foreground, its fractured face illuminated by low golden sunlight from the right. The charcoal asphalt road has a white centreline, narrow yellow margins and a low reddish rubble-stone parapet along its ocean edge. Beyond the bend, pale grey granite slabs and ochre sandstone slopes descend steeply into blue-grey water with narrow white breakers. The sky is clear pale cream-blue, with warm haze over a distant low coastal plateau.",
